The bundled tables retain selected ASCII-compatible candidates, their original
full-model norms, and every nonzero byte-pair weight. Name profiles omit pure
ASCII pairs; comment profiles retain them as continuous-text evidence. Delta-coded
keys in the uncompressed bigram-models.bin resource preserve the values without
retraining. JAR packaging supplies compression; the resource has no compression wrapper.
